# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity generated folders.
#
# Everything here is rebuilt by the editor from Assets/ + ProjectSettings/ +
# Packages/, so committing it only bloats the repository (Library/ alone is
# several GB) and produces constant spurious diffs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
.utmp/

# Vuforia local runtime cache (licence handshake / telemetry). Machine-specific.
QCAR/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / solution files. Regenerated on demand by the Unity editor.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
ExportedObj/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.apk
*.aab
*.app
*.unitypackage
crashlytics-build.properties
sysinfo.txt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored, despite what some Unity .gitignore templates say:
#
#   Assets/**/*.meta      Unity identifies every asset by the GUID in its .meta
#                         file. Dropping them breaks every reference in every
#                         scene and prefab on a fresh clone.
#   Assets/StreamingAssets/Vuforia/   the target database (.dat/.xml) is source,
#                         not build output -- the app cannot track without it.
#   ProjectSettings/      contains the render pipeline, input handler, package
#                         name and Vuforia licence configuration.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Too large for GitHub, and not ours to redistribute.
#
# The Vuforia package tarball is 138 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file
# limit, so a push containing it is rejected outright. It is also PTC's
# redistributable, not project source. See README for how to restore it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Packages/*.tgz

# Vuforia Core Samples: ~90 MB of astronaut models and textures, kept locally as
# reference implementations but referenced by nothing in this application.
Assets/SamplesResources/
Assets/SamplesResources.meta

# Internal working notes, kept locally but not part of the deliverable.
docs/DIARIO-SVILUPPO.md
